OL,3,GNEWSARevised plans for developments
OL,4,Aafter backlash
OL,5,
OL,6,FA council has renewed plans for the
OL,7,Fredevelopment of riverside land after
OL,8,Fprevious objections.
OL,10,FNewcastle City Council's cabinet has
OL,11,Fbeen asked to approve the sale of
OL,12,FSpillers Quay, in Ouseburn, in the hope
OL,13,Fof accelerating its redevelopment,
OL,14,Falong with nearby Malmo Quay, with
OL,15,Fplans for new homes.
OL,17,FA proposed 223ft tower at Malmo saw a
OL,18,Fhuge backlash from residents and
OL,19,Fbusinesses in 2022, meanwhile previous
OL,20,Fplans for flats at Spillers had to be
OL,21,Frevised to four storeys rather than
OL,22,Feight after complaints.
OL,23,APub: 12-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NE Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
