OL,3,GNEWSARevised plans for developments
OL,4,Aafter backlash
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe council said it had worked with
OL,7,Flocal councillors and the Ouseburn
OL,8,FTrust on the new proposals and any
OL,9,Fbuilding work would preserve the view
OL,10,Fof the Quayside skyline from the east
OL,11,Fof the city.
